{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act19side_level_act19side_st01",
  "groupId": "act19side",
  "stageId": "act19side_st01",
  "title": "Retrograde",
  "storyCode": "DV-ST-1",
  "avgTag": "Interlude",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act19side/level_act19side_st01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "315266b707d8fe542f1ee1a0b8bcbde7710c09d590980df706f3e441d95347ec",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hello. You've reached the office of Rhine Lab Control, Kristen Wright.\nMs. Wright is currently unable to take your call. Please leave your message after the tone. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "This is bad, Kristen. I think I screwed up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'll admit the Colonel's smart. He caught onto my 'little tricks' last time I made a delivery."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "He's been all eyes on me along with Ferdinand's people. It took a whole bunch of clones just to get away here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ferdinand's gonna make his move at Rhine soon enough, I just know it... and the other Directors have to fall in line. The only other option is to play dumb."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Ugh, jeez. I might have nowhere to run anymore, seriously."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "I'm a little scared. Just a tiny, tiny bit, but... you get where I'm coming from, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Not to worry, though. I'm still going to uphold our agreement, 100%."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "—Kristen... I can't help but wonder..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Answering Machine",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "If she was still here, maybe we wouldn't..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Ms. Muelsyse, I suggest you stop struggling."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Your marathon from Rhine HQ to the commercial district's wasted our entire evening."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "...*Sigh*."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Lemme guessie, dead end for me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "You'll always catch me as long as I'm somewhere in Trimounts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "No. Forget Trimounts. It'd be the same in any city."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "This is Columbia. The charges stick to lawbreakers, rain or shine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "This is about me breaking confidentiality with the military, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "In which case, you should give me some time to call my lawyer—and not sic a kajillion armed mercs on me in the middle of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I'll say again. We're in Columbia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "We don't operate by the books unless 'by the books' is what we need. In other scenarios, we like efficiency."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Alright. Do I still get a little chat with Ferdinand? Maybe me and him can still straighten out this whole mix-up before it's too late."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Nuh-uh. That's not in my orders here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "D... Didn't Ferdinand hire you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Ferdinand Clooney might be your coworker, but he's just a partner of convenience to me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I've got no personal stake in the Rhine infighting. Ecological? Energy? I don't give a damn and my employer doesn't care who exactly we're cooperating with."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "What we want is results. Rhine Lab provides the goods, my employer puts thought into their use."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "And your tiny little 'oops moment' lost you the last ounces of our trust."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "If I said... I didn't mean to, would you believe me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "I'm a researcher, ya know? I've got this habit of hanging onto test data here and there."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Habit? You had all this time to think of an excuse, and that's it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I'm so, so sorry to tell you, your fancy brand of charisma doesn't work on me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I'm given to understand Ferdinand warned you not to let a whisper of any of the testing leak before the government passed every bill tied to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Your Elven blood's stretched the expiration date on your good looks. That likewise ensures you don't form any forgetful habits, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "You—!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "You know I'm..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "An Elf?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I read the files. I know who I'm working with. Part of my job, y'see."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "So, come, let's cooperate some. Whatever illusion you were going to concoct next, it'd be as useless as the last."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Sheesh, I guess I really am cornered."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I guess that's why you were stalling so long... You think you can dupe me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "I'm not the brute forcing type, I don't go off half-cocked, and I'm not one of your colleagues married to the lab."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Got you."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "*cough* *cough*..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "At this temperature... water molecules... don't hear my call..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Is this your Arts... or some kind of special technology?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "I..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Are you really free enough to discuss issues of science with me, 'Director' Muelsyse?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Sorry, but I'm tired of playing hide-and-seek, and I don't want any sudden 'acts' of iced water getting my plumage or hair wet."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Hahah... you're... no ordinary merc..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Flattered."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Now, you still have one last chance—answer my question."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Kristen Wright, Rhine Lab Control, has spent the past several years buying up a massive amount of high-purity hard material from companies high and low. What kind of experiment is she running?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Hfff... hkaah... why are you helping Ferdinand if you and your employer—care so much about Control's tests?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "That's not the right answer. That's not AN answer. That's another question, in fact."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Nngh..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "I don't have... any of... the answers you're looking for."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Your file says you love using your blood-given abilities to toy with people. I'm a little surprised you turned out to be so loyal to the Control."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Loyal...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "I'm just... looking out for... myself..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Aww... you're telling me you don't want this chance at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "In which case, Ms. Muelsyse—"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_536_1",
      "text": "Our partnership is hereby terminated."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Terminated...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "???",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "Terminate her."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "Saria..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Muelsyse",
      "speakerId": "char_249_muesys",
      "text": "You've gotta make it in time... for Kristen..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "2:43 A.M. \\ Overcast\nMain District of Trimounts"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "Still waiting for your appointment, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "She should've been here ten minutes ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "I've never counted on her to be punctual, but if our last comms were anything to go by, she was the one desperate for this meeting."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "Maybe she backed out again..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "We all know the Director of Rhine Lab Ecological prefers to hide the truth behind all those smiles of hers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "I don't trust Muelsyse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "I wouldn't easily trust anyone choosing to remain at Rhine Lab at this point."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "But partnerships are built on more than just trust. Did you trust me the moment I first met you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "*cough*... The truth, ma'am?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "When I saw you standing outside my door, I almost went straight to the kitchen to grab a knife or something, and call the cops along the way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Good head on your shoulders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Still, Rhine Lab wouldn't use force to threaten a retired employee who signed an NDA."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "At least, not while I was still in Defense."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "A new message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "Something wrong, ma'am? You look serious... serious enough to give me shivers."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Change of plans."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Muelsyse isn't coming."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "S... Something happened to her? Right when she was about to meet you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Erikson, I need a favor."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Trimountarian",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_524_1",
      "text": "W-What is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Send the info I received to the local branch of this pharmaceutical company."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "Ask their operators to immediately inform Dr. Kal'tsit and Dr. {@nickname}—I know they've been in Columbian territory recently."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Saria",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_532_1",
      "text": "I need their help."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "5:11 A.M. \\ Overcast\nTest Site 359, Trimounts Outskirts"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
      "text": "Morning, Doctor. You're up as early as ever."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Well-regulated circadian rhythm promotes stability of core data.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "D... Data? You mean physiologically, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Haha, you always pack that special sense of humor."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "*sigh*... I pulled an all-nighter just to get these figures. Director Franks is gonna rag on me for this."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Negative. Scenario inconsistent with typical behavior of Dorothy Franks.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Uh, is that supposed to reassure me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Thanks... but even if she lets it fly, there's still Director Clooney, and I don't wanna go back to him..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "You're overdue for a good night's sleep, Helen."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Elena... you know we have evaluations next week. How am I supposed to sleep with an eval weighing on me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "I can't lose this job. I'm still paying off my student loans..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Sorry, I know I keep bringing that up."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Hm... how's this sound? I'll raise your situation with the Director once the experiment's over."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "S-Seriously? Elena... you're the only one in all of Energy who isn't terrified of Director Clooney. What's your secret?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "You've just gotta be like me..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Spending every single day in the lab, making the Director happy with every last thing you do? Th—That's not realistic for me..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Rhine Lab Tech",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_529_1",
          "text": "Oh, right! I needed to check in with Director Franks! Gotta go!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "See you."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "I made coffee. You want some?"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Excessive caffeine intake may aggravate Oripathy, Elena.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "I hear you, but I'm still not about to give up my life for the word 'may.'"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "If the docs had the final word, I'd be best off staying at Rhodes Island with my sister."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Same for you, right, Joyce? Medical wants you aboard long-term."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Regulations state I must report back to Rhine Lab at regular intervals.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Provision of medical services at this site is only a temporary assignment.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Sure... just a few days, and then you'll meet back up with Dr. Silence in the city, right?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Me and Dorothy'll miss you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Joyce needs rest. Work gets too intense here at the site."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "???",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "And you, Elena. If it wasn't for Ferdinand talking you up as his most outstanding researcher, I'd be on the case to kick you back to the city too."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "So you're here at last, Dorothy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Helen just went looking for you. You didn't run into her?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "Sorry, I wasn't paying attention..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Seriously, you're gonna work until you faint, huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Forget me and Joyce, how many days have you gone without sleep? I've seen the wrappers filling up your lab's trash can over the past week. Agrypnotics, huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "The experiment's already in its final phase. I promised the participants I'd accelerate the pace, so they can get back to their families sooner."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Got me there. Who doesn't want this done sooner?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Plus, as your assistant, I have to listen to you anyway."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "Alright—can I ask my beloved assistant to do me another little favor, then?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "I can't be out of the lab for too long. I want you to courier these heat-emitter modules to some friends outside."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Heat-emitters? We've been in the barrens for over a month. Where'd you buy these?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "I..."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Warning. Rhine Lab technological components detected.",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "See? It took me and Joyce one look to know you made these with lab materials."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "The living fossils up in Business won't like that. You might be Director of Originium Arts Director, but that's not gonna change their tune any."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "I know how their minds work."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "And I know even better that you won't report something this minor to Ferdinand, or any of the Directors for that matter."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "They need these things. It's been getting cold lately, and their huts weren't built to last. They won't keep the chills out."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Dorothy."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "I've been wanting to say... Don't you think you worry too much about them?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "They're... Pioneers. A team of them in Rhine Lab's employ."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "No Pioneer's gonna hang around anywhere for long, let alone make friends."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "They're just a bunch of kids."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "Besides, I know what you're trying to say. You're worried about me. You're worried I'll feel empty once they're gone."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "That's my little assistant, always so considerate..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Don't grin at me like that. You're not my teacher, Director Franks."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Dorothy",
          "speakerId": "avg_4048_doroth_1",
          "text": "Elena..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Fine, I'll do you this one last favor. The very last one."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Seeing as... the experiment's nearly over."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Sir, we're all set."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Sonny... Sir?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Got the heebie-jeebies?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "What? Nah, that's never been my style."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "You've been pacing laps about the cabin. Seven, coming up eight."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "I'm just, uh... I'm getting my mind in order. Lotta variables, what's coming up next."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Sonny, I've been thinking, but, uh, are we really on the right track here?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Them scientists, and the doc, they've been plenty good to us, I say."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "I told y'all already, one or two acts of kindness don't make a saint."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Back in law school, my classmates loved to all that charitable business—"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "You know, donate a thing or three to treatment zones for Infected, maybe join a campus debate for justice, for what they went through."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "But once I came to be an unlucky, ill-ridden son-of-a-gun too, well, guess how many times they visited me?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Yeah?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Not a single goddamned time."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "A year back, I went to borrow some money from an old college roommate. He worked at the biggest law firm in Max D.C."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Picked up the phone, get this. He asked me who I was."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "'Sorry, you were out deferred for treatment, so that's why the grad yearbook didn't have your contact.' —Ha!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Most touching joke I ever heard, I tell you."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Real band of bastards, huh? We've seen plenty of 'em ourselves, all of us."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Once they're at a safe enough distance, it stokes their egos good to throw out a little benevolence, like they're feeding fowl, and it makes a topic for their get-togethers too."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "You go on and guess... if right this moment, in that laboratory, those respectable scientists are cradling their coffee cups talking about us, huh?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Nobody minds doling out good intent, not until it costs them anything for real."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Alright, boss, whatever you say."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "You seen the most of us, paid it most mind. Your word is gold."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "This is the only way we've got."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Sonny",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_535_1",
          "text": "Nobody in the whole damned test site's gonna look out for us, 'cept ourselves."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "C'mon, Joyce, once I finish my coffee, we've got to get to work."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Medic... we need a medic!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "You're one of the Pioneers?"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "You can't really just come in... uh, you haven't gone through decontam yet..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Don't you have a medic or a doctor? Something came over Sam all of a sudden, he's sick!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Sick...? Is it Oripathy?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "Are you? Are you a doctor? You gotta save him, you gotta save ol' Sam, save us all!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pioneer",
          "speakerId": "avg_npc_534_1",
          "text": "He's been running like a kettle since late last night, and he's just started throwing up blood!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
