          "text": "Sure aren't, Joyce. These are some healthy young men here."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Elena",
          "speakerId": "avg_135_halo_1",
          "text": "Wouldn't have the strength to be pointing dangerous tools at us otherwise."
